  ('NFCA-R11 §1.1', 'NFCA-R11', 'Market Conduct Rule', '1.1', 'Purpose', 'This rule sets out the Authority''s requirements for trading communications and market surveillance.', '2025-02-28'),
  ('NFCA-R11 §1.2', 'NFCA-R11', 'Market Conduct Rule', '1.2', 'Application', 'This rule applies to every firm authorised by the Authority, including branches that serve customers in its jurisdiction.', '2025-02-28'),
  ('NFCA-R11 §1.3', 'NFCA-R11', 'Market Conduct Rule', '1.3', 'Definitions', 'In this rule, ''senior manager'' means an individual approved by the Authority to hold a senior management function.', '2025-02-28'),
  ('NFCA-R11 §1.4', 'NFCA-R11', 'Market Conduct Rule', '1.4', 'Proportionality', 'A firm must apply this rule in a way that is proportionate to the nature, scale and complexity of its business.', '2025-02-28'),
  ('NFCA-R11 §2.1', 'NFCA-R11', 'Market Conduct Rule', '2.1', 'Trading communications capture', 'A firm must record and retain electronic communications relating to trading activity.', '2025-02-28'),
  ('NFCA-R11 §2.6', 'NFCA-R11', 'Market Conduct Rule', '2.6', 'Trading communications capture: evidence', 'A firm must keep evidence that it meets clause 2.1 and make that evidence available to the Authority on request.', '2025-02-28'),
  ('NFCA-R11 §3.2', 'NFCA-R11', 'Market Conduct Rule', '3.2', 'Surveillance alert review timeliness', 'A firm must monitor trading activity to detect potential market abuse and review alerts within five business days.', '2025-02-28'),
  ('NFCA-R11 §3.7', 'NFCA-R11', 'Market Conduct Rule', '3.7', 'Surveillance alert review timeliness: evidence', 'A firm must keep evidence that it meets clause 3.2 and make that evidence available to the Authority on request.', '2025-02-28'),
  ('NFCA-R11 §5.1', 'NFCA-R11', 'Market Conduct Rule', '5.1', 'Governance', 'A firm''s board is responsible for approving the policies that implement this rule and for overseeing their effectiveness.', '2025-02-28'),
  ('NFCA-R11 §5.2', 'NFCA-R11', 'Market Conduct Rule', '5.2', 'Documentation', 'A firm must document how it meets each requirement of this rule and keep that documentation up to date.', '2025-02-28'),
  ('NFCA-R11 §6.1', 'NFCA-R11', 'Market Conduct Rule', '6.1', 'Breaches', 'A firm must notify the Authority promptly if it becomes aware that it has breached this rule.', '2025-02-28'),
  ('NFCA-R11 §6.2', 'NFCA-R11', 'Market Conduct Rule', '6.2', 'Transition', 'A firm must comply with this rule from its effective date unless the Authority has granted a written waiver.', '2025-02-28'),
